;***** Update: 20240823

; Change T0 -> T1 (layer 2 2/2)
; layer 2 at 0.6mm
T1

; --- Standby temperature for inactive extruder (reduces ooze during toolchange) ---
; PA612-CF15 standby recommendation: 220C
;  ; löst leider die Ozing Probleme nicht
; -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

M107 P0 ;fan off T0



M2000 S200 V300 A3000 ;quick switch extruders, S:200 mode/V:speed/A:acceleration
M109 T1 S210 C3 W1 ;wait T1

  M106 P1 S255 ;restore fan speed for T1

