; -------------------------------------------------------------------------------

M107 P1 ;fan off T1



M2000 S200 V300 A3000 ;quick switch extruders, S:200 mode/V:speed/A:acceleration
M109 T0 S210 C3 W1 ;wait T0

  M106 P0 S255 ;restore fan speed for T0

